wechat.description:
**Recommended for gas; no SMS code needed.**

1. Open the [Town-gas WeChat authorization page]({authorize_url}) in WeChat (or scan the QR code in the README);
2. Finish the WeChat authorization; the browser ends on a broken `__ha_capture.html?code=xxxxx` page;
3. **Copy the FULL URL from the address bar immediately** and paste it below (each code is one-time and short-lived);
4. The integration exchanges the code for an access_token, lists your gas accounts and refreshes the balance every 30 minutes.

You can also paste `{"access_token":"...","refresh_token":"..."}`. The token auto-renews every 2 hours and the renewed token is saved back into the HA config entry.

{error}

sms.description:
Enter the SMS code you received (gas: 5 digits; water needs no image captcha). Tick resend to send again.

{sms_status}

If the official gas website also fails to deliver SMS, call 96969 to check the registered number, or use manual access_token.

If water SMS never arrives, use Phone only instead - same result.

{error}

org.description:
Both orgCodes belong to Shandong Towngas Co., Ltd.: 10401_JNGH0105 (Gaoxin Customer Service Center) and SDJH0105 (head office). Pick the service center shown on your bill, or keep the default.

If the official website itself also fails to deliver an SMS, the issue is the registered phone number / carrier channel, not this integration. Call 96969 to verify, or use manual access_token.

{error}
